      "description": "As seen on Scam School. Move your iPhone (and small objects) with your MIND!\nSearch iTelekinect on YouTube to see a demo.\n\nFrom the creator of iForce, Inject, and ReaList.\n\nThe power to move objects is now yours ...\n\nBring out your iPhone.\nStand it on it's edge.\nNo Strings, No Magnets, No Wires ... just you and your phone.\n\nStep away from your phone to prove you're not attached.\nReach out your hand. Hold your breath. Concentrate.\nSuddenly ... Unexplainably ... your phone starts to MOVE!?\n\nExhale. Breathe. Lower your hand ... your mind exhausted from the intense exertion.\n\nPick up your phone and hand it out for examination.\n\niTelekinect 2 features:\n\n◆ Super EASY ... Perform one minute after downloading (video tutorial is included).\n◆ Cause small objects (ring, coin, etc) to fall off your iPhone or move on your phone!\n◆ Control exactly where and when objects move on your phone.\n◆ NEW - SIX input methods: Volume, Touch, Proximity, BT Keyboard, Apple Watch, and Camera.\n◆ NEW - With Apple Watch, control your iPhone (and animations) even if you're NOT running the app!?\n◆ NEW - Perform IMPOSSIBLE PK Touch effects ... They'll feel your touch, but you NEVER touch them!\n◆ NEW - Customize everything with your own images or videos.\n◆ NEW - Remotely trigger sounds, vibrations, and flashlight using ANY input.\n◆ GREAT for freaking out your friends!\n\nPLEASE NOTE:\nYour phone will only move if it's not in a case, and is placed on a smooth surface.\nObjects WILL move on the face of your phone (with or without a case)\n\nThis app is intended for entertainment purposes and does not provide true telekinesis functionality.\n\nQuestions?\nEmail: grostami@gmail.com",
